# Git worktrees created by Claude Code. Full repo checkouts -- never commit these.
.claude/worktrees/

# CI is written but parked — see docs/HANDOFF.md.
#
# Ignored rather than merely uncommitted because pushing .github/workflows/
# needs a token with `workflow` scope, and this repo's credential (Git
# Credential Manager) does not have it. A committed workflow file therefore
# blocks EVERY subsequent push, not just its own — so a stray `git add -A`
# would wedge the repo for reasons that look nothing like the cause.
#
# To enable: get a token with `workflow` scope, then `git add -f .github`.
.github/
